1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:02,220
Everyone at my gym is guessing.

2
00:00:03,510 --> 00:00:05,490
Wait, how many sets is this?

3
00:00:05,710 --> 00:00:07,160
My agent wrote mine.

4
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:11,970
My own AI agent plans my workouts and meals. FitLoop puts them in my glasses.

5
00:00:11,970 --> 00:00:15,100
Set done? One tap. The rest timer starts itself.

6
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:18,340
Something hurts? I tell my agent, mid-set.

7
00:00:21,450 --> 00:00:24,420
